{%- comment -%}
  Mobile sticky Add-to-cart bar (product page).

  On a 390px viewport the real Add to cart sits ~1,000px deep — 1.5 screens
  below the fold. This bar keeps the buy action reachable the whole way down:
  title + live price left, Add to cart right, fixed to the bottom edge.
  Mobile only (<750px) — the desktop info column already keeps the button
  in reach.

  Mechanics mirror the proven cart sticky bar:
  - It is a SECOND submit button, not a moved one — `form` attribute points at
    the real product form, so ProductForm's AJAX add + toast run unchanged and
    the form's variant id + quantity inputs are honoured.
  - sticky-atc-bar.js shows it only while the real submit button is off screen
    and hides it as soon as the footer enters the viewport.
  - Price and button state (Sold out / Unavailable) follow variant changes by
    mirroring the real elements with MutationObservers — no dependency on
    pubsub timing.

  Accepts:
  - product: {Object} product
  - section_id: {String} section.id of main-product

  Usage (from main-product.liquid, after the buy buttons exist):
  {%- render 'sticky-atc-bar', product: product, section_id: section.id -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'component-sticky-atc.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{%- liquid
  assign sab_form_id = 'product-form-' | append: section_id
  assign sab_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant
-%}
<div class="sticky-atc" data-section="{{ section_id }}">
  <div class="sticky-atc__info">
    <span class="sticky-atc__title">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
    <div class="sticky-atc__price" id="StickyAtcPrice-{{ section_id }}">
      {%- render 'price', product: product, use_variant: true -%}
    </div>
  </div>
  <button
    type="submit"
    form="{{ sab_form_id }}"
    id="StickyAtcButton-{{ section_id }}"
    class="sticky-atc__button button"
    {% if sab_variant == null or sab_variant.available == false %}
      disabled
    {% endif %}
  >
    <span>
      {%- if sab_variant == null -%}
        {{ 'products.product.unavailable' | t }}
      {%- elsif sab_variant.available == false -%}
        {{ 'products.product.sold_out' | t }}
      {%- else -%}
        {{ 'products.product.add_to_cart' | t }}
      {%- endif -%}
    </span>
  </button>
</div>
<script src="{{ 'sticky-atc-bar.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>
